      "name": "Archfiend's Origin",
      "effect": "If this card is in your hand: You can Tribute 1 other \"Archfiend\" monster from your hand or field; Special Summon this card. If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can Special Summon 1 Level 6 Fiend monster with 2500 ATK from your hand, Deck, or GY. When your opponent activates a monster effect and you control \"Summoned Skull\" (Quick Effect): You can negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that card. You can only use each effect of \"Archfiend's Origin\" once per turn.",
